  "data": {
    "topic": "return-exchange",
    "title": "Returns and Exchanges Policy",
    "bodyHtml": "<div style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:18px;color:#111111;max-width:100%;\">\n <p style=\"font-size:18px;color:#111111 !important;line-height:1.7;margin:0 0 24px 0;\">BigBike is committed to a clear returns and exchanges process. Please read the conditions below carefully before ordering to avoid unexpected issues.</p>\n <h2 style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,\">1. Return and exchange periods</h2>\n <table style=\"width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:18px;margin:0 0 16px 0;\">\n  <thead>\n   <tr>\n    <th style=\"padding:12px 16px;border:1px solid #dddddd;background-color:#f5f5f5;font-weight:bold;color:#111111 !important;text-align:left;width:35%;\">Request type</th>\n    <th style=\"padding:12px 16px;border:1px solid #dddddd;background-color:#f5f5f5;font-weight:bold;color:#111111 !important;text-align:left;width:20%;\">Period</th>\n    <th style=\"padding:12px 16px;border:1px solid #dddddd;background-color:#f5f5f5;font-weight:bold;color:#111111 !important;text-align:left;\">Condition</th>\n   </tr>\n  </thead>\n  <tbody>\n   <tr>\n    <td style=\"padding:12px 16px;border:1px solid #dddddd;font-weight:bold;color:#111111 !important;\">Size or product exchange</td>\n    <td style=\"padding:12px 16px;border:1px solid #dddddd;color:#111111 !important;\"><strong style=\"font-size:22px;color:#cc0906 !important;\">7 days</strong><br><span style=\"font-size:14px;color:#6f6f6f !important;\">from receipt</span></td>\n    <td style=\"padding:12px 16px;border:1px solid #dddddd;font-size:14px;color:#111111 !important;\">Exchange for another size or a different product of equal or greater value</td>\n   </tr>\n   <tr>\n    <td style=\"padding:12px 16px;border:1px solid #dddddd;font-weight:bold;color:#111111 !important;\">Refund or return</td>\n    <td style=\"padding:12px 16px;border:1px solid #dddddd;color:#111111 !important;\"><strong style=\"font-size:22px;color:#cc0906 !important;\">1 day</strong><br><span style=\"font-size:14px;color:#6f6f6f !important;\">from receipt</span></td>\n    <td style=\"padding:12px 16px;border:1px solid #dddddd;font-size:14px;color:#111111 !important;\">Change of mind immediately after receipt, or a defective product</td>\n   </tr>\n  </tbody>\n </table>\n <div style=\"border:1px solid #dddddd;border-left:4px solid #cc0906;padding:16px;margin:0 0 24px 0;\">\n  <p style=\"font-size:18px;color:#111111 !important;margin:0;line-height:1.7;\"><strong style=\"color:#cc0906 !important;\">Important:</strong> After 1 day, if the product has no defect, BigBike only supports an <strong style=\"color:#111111 !important;\">exchange for another product</strong> — no refund. Shipping fees will be agreed by both parties depending on the order value.</p>\n </div>\n <h2 style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,\">2. Return and exchange conditions</h2>\n <div style=\"display:flex;gap:16px;margin:0 0 24px 0;flex-wrap:wrap;\">\n  <div style=\"flex:1;min-width:240px;border:1px solid #dddddd;padding:16px;\">\n   <p style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,\">✓ Accepted</p>\n   <ul style=\"margin:0;padding:0 0 0 20px;line-height:1.8;\">\n    <li style=\"margin-bottom:8px;color:#111111 !important;\">Original tags, seals and packaging remain intact</li>\n    <li style=\"margin-bottom:8px;color:#111111 !important;\">Unused — not worn outdoors and not washed</li>\n    <li style=\"margin-bottom:8px;color:#111111 !important;\">All original accessories are included in the box</li>\n    <li style=\"color:#111111 !important;\">BigBike is contacted within the applicable period</li>\n   </ul>\n  </div>\n  <div style=\"flex:1;min-width:240px;border:1px solid #dddddd;padding:16px;\">\n   <p style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,\">✗ Not eligible</p>\n   <ul style=\"margin:0;padding:0 0 0 20px;line-height:1.8;\">\n    <li style=\"margin-bottom:8px;color:#111111 !important;\">Used or washed, even once</li>\n    <li style=\"margin-bottom:8px;color:#111111 !important;\">Seal removed or packaging lost, even if unused</li>\n    <li style=\"color:#111111 !important;\">Made-to-order products or products ordered with a customer-requested deposit</li>\n   </ul>\n  </div>\n </div>\n <h2 style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,\">3. Sale and promotional products</h2>\n <table style=\"width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:18px;margin:0 0 24px 0;\">\n  <thead>\n   <tr>\n    <th style=\"padding:12px 16px;border:1px solid #dddddd;background-color:#f5f5f5;font-weight:bold;color:#111111 !important;text-align:left;width:50%;\">Request</th>\n    <th style=\"padding:12px 16px;border:1px solid #dddddd;background-color:#f5f5f5;font-weight:bold;color:#111111 !important;text-align:left;\">Availability</th>\n   </tr>\n  </thead>\n  <tbody>\n   <tr>\n    <td style=\"padding:12px 16px;border:1px solid #dddddd;color:#111111 !important;\">Exchange for a product of equal or greater value</td>\n    <td style=\"padding:12px 16px;border:1px solid #dddddd;color:#111111 !important;\"><strong style=\"color:#111111 !important;\">✓ Supported</strong> — within or outside the original category</td>\n   </tr>\n   <tr>\n    <td style=\"padding:12px 16px;border:1px solid #dddddd;color:#111111 !important;\">Refund or return</td>\n    <td style=\"padding:12px 16px;border:1px solid #dddddd;color:#111111 !important;\"><strong style=\"color:#cc0906 !important;\">✗ Not available</strong> for sale products</td>\n   </tr>\n  </tbody>\n </table>\n <h2 style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,\">4. Return and exchange shipping fees</h2>\n <table style=\"width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:18px;margin:0 0 24px 0;\">\n  <thead>\n   <tr>\n    <th style=\"padding:12px 16px;border:1px solid #dddddd;background-color:#f5f5f5;font-weight:bold;color:#111111 !important;text-align:left;width:55%;\">Case</th>\n    <th style=\"padding:12px 16px;border:1px solid #dddddd;background-color:#f5f5f5;font-weight:bold;color:#111111 !important;text-align:left;\">Shipping fee</th>\n   </tr>\n  </thead>\n  <tbody>\n   <tr>\n    <td style=\"padding:12px 16px;border:1px solid #dddddd;color:#111111 !important;\">Customer selected the size and wants another size</td>\n    <td style=\"padding:12px 16px;border:1px solid #dddddd;color:#111111 !important;\"><strong>Paid by the customer</strong></td>\n   </tr>\n   <tr>\n    <td style=\"padding:12px 16px;border:1px solid #dddddd;color:#111111 !important;\">BigBike advised and confirmed the size, but it does not fit</td>\n    <td style=\"padding:12px 16px;border:1px solid #dddddd;color:#111111 !important;\"><strong>Paid by BigBike</strong></td>\n   </tr>\n   <tr>\n    <td style=\"padding:12px 16px;border:1px solid #dddddd;color:#111111 !important;\">Manufacturing defect, incorrect item, or item damaged on receipt</td>\n    <td style=\"padding:12px 16px;border:1px solid #dddddd;color:#111111 !important;\"><strong>100% paid by BigBike</strong></td>\n   </tr>\n   <tr>\n    <td style=\"padding:12px 16px;border:1px solid #dddddd;color:#111111 !important;\">Exchange for another product or a sale product</td>\n    <td style=\"padding:12px 16px;border:1px solid #dddddd;color:#111111 !important;\">Agreed by both parties according to the order value</td>\n   </tr>\n  </tbody>\n </table>\n <h2 style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,\">5. Return and exchange process</h2>\n <table style=\"width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:18px;margin:0 0 24px 0;\">\n  <tbody>\n   <tr>\n    <td style=\"padding:12px 16px;border:1px solid #dddddd;width:44px;text-align:center;vertical-align:top;\"><strong style=\"font-size:24px;color:#cc0906 !important;\">1</strong></td>\n    <td style=\"padding:12px 16px;border:1px solid #dddddd;color:#111111 !important;vertical-align:top;\"><strong>Contact BigBike within the applicable period</strong><br>\n      Please call Hotline 0906 902 404, message Zalo 0764 640 679 - Mrs. Thu / Zalo or message Messenger Bigbike.vn. Describe the reason and send product photos or video.</td>\n   </tr>\n   <tr>\n    <td style=\"padding:12px 16px;border:1px solid #dddddd;text-align:center;vertical-align:top;\"><strong style=\"font-size:24px;color:#cc0906 !important;\">2</strong></td>\n    <td style=\"padding:12px 16px;border:1px solid #dddddd;color:#111111 !important;vertical-align:top;\"><strong>Wait for BigBike's confirmation</strong><br>\n      BigBike responds within 2–4 hours during business hours, checks the conditions and confirms whether the return or exchange is accepted.</td>\n   </tr>\n   <tr>\n    <td style=\"padding:12px 16px;border:1px solid #dddddd;text-align:center;vertical-align:top;\"><strong style=\"font-size:24px;color:#cc0906 !important;\">3</strong></td>\n    <td style=\"padding:12px 16px;border:1px solid #dddddd;color:#111111 !important;vertical-align:top;\"><strong>Send the product to BigBike</strong><br>\n      Pack it securely and clearly write your name and phone number. Send it to 79/30/52 Au Co, Ward 14, District 11, Ho Chi Minh City.</td>\n   </tr>\n   <tr>\n    <td style=\"padding:12px 16px;border:1px solid #dddddd;text-align:center;vertical-align:top;\"><strong style=\"font-size:24px;color:#cc0906 !important;\">4</strong></td>\n    <td style=\"padding:12px 16px;border:1px solid #dddddd;color:#111111 !important;vertical-align:top;\"><strong>Receive the replacement or refund</strong><br>\n      BigBike processes the request within <strong>2–3 business days</strong> after receiving the returned product, then ships the replacement or issues the agreed refund.</td>\n   </tr>\n  </tbody>\n </table>\n <h2 style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,\">Returns and exchanges support</h2>\n <table style=\"width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:18px;margin:0;\">\n  <tbody>\n   <tr>\n    <th scope=\"row\">Hotline</th>\n    <td>0906 902 404</td>\n   </tr>\n   <tr>\n    <th scope=\"row\">Zalo support</th>\n    <td>0764 640 679 - Mrs. Thu / Zalo</td>\n   </tr>\n   <tr>\n    <th scope=\"row\">Messenger</th>\n    <td>Bigbike.vn</td>\n   </tr>\n   <tr>\n    <th scope=\"row\">Business hours</th>\n    <td>Mon - Fri: 09:00 - 21:00 · Sat / Sun: 09:00 - 18:00</td>\n   </tr>\n   <tr>\n    <th scope=\"row\">Address</th>\n    <td>79/30/52 Au Co, Ward 14, District 11, Ho Chi Minh City</td>\n   </tr>\n  </tbody>\n </table>\n</div>",
    "updatedAt": "2026-09-01T00:00:00Z"
  }
